# JAYSTARBLISS STUDIOS — COMPLETE DASHBOARD UX, DATA VISUALIZATION & BRAND CONSISTENCY REDESIGN

## PROJECT OBJECTIVE

I want a comprehensive redesign of the authenticated dashboards and their information-presentation system.

The current application contains too many conventional cards, repetitive information blocks, unnecessary rounded badges, inconsistent colours and layouts that make important information harder to find than necessary.

I want the application to feel like a sophisticated, modern educational management platform.

The goal is not to decorate every section or simply replace existing cards with different cards.

The goal is to rethink how information is organized, displayed, understood and accessed.

Users should be able to understand important information quickly, navigate efficiently, and expand individual records when they need additional details.

**Work directly within the existing repository. Inspect the actual implementation before making changes. Preserve all existing application functionality, data relationships, permissions and workflows.**

Repository:
https://github.com/jaystarbliss-dynamic-hub/V3-JAYSTARBLISS-STUDIOS-MAIN-WEBSITE

Use the latest state of the main branch as your baseline, but work on a separate feature branch. Do not directly commit changes to main or deploy automatically.

